@541[2]. The one only thing from which man is man, is...

@CL 185[2]. A thousand things (contrasted With) only one thing.

@380[10]. A centre which he believed to be the only one.

@TCR 22. That God is the Itself, the Only, and the First...

@379. That true faith is the one only one... Explained.

